    /// preview_job_cost, confirm=true after the user approved the total, and an idempotency_key (a
    /// new unique string; reuse it only to retry after a timeout). pay_rate >= 0.05 in every
    /// category, quantity >= 10. New jobs may be held for a short moderation review before going
    /// live. Optional image_prompt: a detailed description of one image we generate with AI and
